  "description": "Os 4 painéis de §9.3 de docs/app/02-arquitetura.md. Provisionado por arquivo: edição no navegador não sobrevive ao restart.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "1. RED da API — taxa, erros e latência",
      "description": "Rate: requisições por segundo por rota. Errors: a série 5xx da mesma janela. Duration: p95 do histograma, no eixo da direita. Só rotas de baixa cardinalidade entram como label (`http-metrics.interceptor.ts`).",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "erro {{status}}",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
